WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.866
"Let's play a game," Rex said.

2
00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:12.522
The buddies were in the forest.

3
00:00:12.523 --> 00:00:15.636
"What should we play?" Sara asked.

4
00:00:15.637 --> 00:00:23.346
"I want to play hide-and-seek," Tor said.

5
00:00:23.347 --> 00:00:26.729
Sid groaned.

6
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.729
"No way!

7
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:32.293
I'm bad at hide-and-seek!"

8
00:00:32.294 --> 00:00:35.370
"Oh, Sid," Rex said.

9
00:00:35.371 --> 00:00:37.772
"Let's play.

10
00:00:37.773 --> 00:00:40.673
Then you'll get better at it."

11
00:00:40.674 --> 00:00:45.691
Sid frowned.

12
00:00:45.692 --> 00:00:52.560
He kicked a rock.

13
00:00:52.561 --> 00:01:00.817
"Okay," he said.

14
00:01:00.818 --> 00:01:02.171
Rex counted.

15
00:01:02.172 --> 00:01:07.722
"One, two, three . . ."

16
00:01:07.723 --> 00:01:16.363
Tor, Sara, and Sid ran off.

17
00:01:16.364 --> 00:01:21.724
Sid saw a hollow log.

18
00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:24.636
He tried to crawl into it.

19
00:01:24.637 --> 00:01:32.351
But Sid was much too big.

20
00:01:32.352 --> 00:01:38.682
Sid saw a big rock.

21
00:01:38.683 --> 00:01:41.954
He ducked behind it.

22
00:01:41.955 --> 00:01:45.475
"Psst, Sid," Sara said.

23
00:01:45.476 --> 00:01:49.506
"I see your tail!"

24
00:01:49.507 --> 00:01:52.321
"Ugh!" Sid said.

25
00:01:52.322 --> 00:01:55.725
"This is why I hate hide-and-seek.

26
00:01:55.726 --> 00:01:59.787
I'm bad at it!"

27
00:01:59.788 --> 00:02:01.843
Suddenly Rex shouted.

28
00:02:01.844 --> 00:02:09.871
"Ready or not, here I come!"

